      "words": 47
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I need to get up, though. Being a reliable sister to Jess is my primary goal for the next eight weeks. Showing up late t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 423
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In honor of living every day like it’s my last, or whatever, I tug on the sequined pink cowgirl boots I usually only wea",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 615
        },
        {
          "text": "I try to imagine how Daniel might react if he saw me in these boots",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 873
        },
        {
          "text": "Then again, he’s a Grim Reaper. He’s uniquely unqualified to know what living your best life even means",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1066
        }
      ],
      "words": 66
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leviathan’s is usually packed on weekday mornings, but today is Sunday",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1169
        },
        {
          "text": "Katie, the barista who takes my drink order almost every day, is wiping nonexistent crumbs off the counter as I approach",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1435
        },
        {
          "text": "A cappuccino with a double shot of espresso, extra foam, made with whole milk, is the missing puzzle piece of routine I ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1974
        }
      ],
      "words": 62
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "As Katie makes my drink, I mentally rehearse the lie about last night that I came up with on my way here. It’s super fli",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2129
        },
        {
          "text": "“I forgot to bring the plaque for the retiring professor last night.” Not a lie, but not remotely the reason I texted Je",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5513
        }
      ],
      "words": 55
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "When I hold the mug up to my lips to take my first sip and see what’s inside, I nearly drop it to the floor in surprise",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2478
        },
        {
          "text": "Two crossed bones beneath a sightless skull",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2882
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’m so sorry! I knew the machine had been acting weird, but",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3048
        },
        {
          "text": "How did that even happen?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3107
        }
      ],
      "words": 52
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“No caffeine allergy,” she says. “God, that would be a fate worse than death.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6727
        },
        {
          "text": "“Please don’t kill me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7126
        },
        {
          "text": "“Liam.” She shakes her head. “I don’t know if I can marry him.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7363
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“He’s too good to be true.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8002
        },
        {
          "text": "“Almost six years.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8355
        },
        {
          "text": "They met one night when Jess and I had to rush Wilfred to the emergency pet hospital after he got into our secret chocol",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8424
        }
      ],
      "words": 42
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You’re nothing like Mom,” I assure her in the quiet voice we always use when we bring her up",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9429
        },
        {
          "text": "You’ve been more of a parent to me than our mother ever was.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9878
        },
        {
          "text": "I can’t be there for my sister for very long after her wedding—but I’ll be the most supportive, most reassuring big sist",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10819
        }
      ],
      "words": 69
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I nearly jump out of my skin at Daniel’s voice. He wasn’t here two minutes ago, but now he’s sitting at the cheap foldin",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14810
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’m here on Agency business,” he explains",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15552
        },
        {
          "text": "“Giving away my right to privacy was never part of our deal.” I scowl",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18279
        }
      ],
      "words": 59
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Strange,” he murmurs. “It’s already here.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19721
        },
        {
          "text": "“What I was trying to give you.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19853
        },
        {
          "text": "But I believe we can communicate with each other in a rudimentary way",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20334
        },
        {
          "text": "When I returned your soul to your body, I may have given you something",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20433
        },
        {
          "text": "extra.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20504
        }
      ],
      "words": 43
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But his usual mask of indifference has fallen completely away. The corners of his mouth kick up into a small, genuine sm",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20951
